= The Militias in the Streets

The human militias are on Coruscant's streets in their thousands. They surround the apartments of Rim and alien senators, and of Caucus members, and there are beatings in the lower levels that the HoloNet does not report. The militias say they stand ready to defend the Chancellor against traitors. Nobody doubts that they will.
